{
  "name": "ListDomainConfigs",
  "summary": "查询加速域名基础信息",
  "tags": "域名操作",
  "productshort": "CDN",
  "region_id": "ap-southeast-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v1.0/cdn/configuration/domains": {
      "get": {
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-history-api": "N",
        "operationId": "ListDomainConfigs",
        "tags": [
          "域名操作"
        ],
        "summary": "查询加速域名基础信息",
        "description": "查询加速域名的基础信息,包含cname状态、加速域名是否支持复制配置。\n- 单租户调用频率:5次/s。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n用户鉴权Token,通过调用IAM服务获取用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "domain_names",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n加速域名\n - 多个域名使用英文半角逗号分隔\n - 当查询cname状态时,该参数必传\n\n**约束限制:**\n仅支持查询已经在CDN添加成功的域名\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "required": false
          },
          {
            "name": "item",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n查询数据类型\n**约束限制:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n- cname_status: 域名cname状态\n- copy: 查询账号下哪些加速域名支持复制配置\n\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "name": "enterprise_project_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n企业项目id。您可以通过调用企业项目管理服务(EPS)的查询企业项目列表接口(ListEnterpriseProject)查询企业项目id\n**约束限制:**\n当用户开启企业项目功能时,该参数生效,表示查询资源所属项目,\"all\"表示所有项目\n**取值范围:**\n不涉及\n**默认取值:**\n不涉及",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "required": false
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "成功响应。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DomainCnameStatusRsp"
                },
                "example": {
                  "cname_status": [
                    {
                      "status": 0,
                      "domain_name": "www.example.com"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "错误响应。",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrRsp"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "GET https://cdn.myhuaweicloud.com/v1.0/cdn/configuration/domains?domain_names=www.example.com&item=cname_status"
      }
    }
  },
